text Not long after I transferred into this school... it was in chaos.
text All that mattered was strength. The weak had no choice but to follow the strong.
text A number of factions were formed, and battles dotted the school's landscape.
text It was no time to be taking classes. Even the teachers had holed themselves up in the teachers' room.
text That was life at school. And while I was a transfer student, I still made sparks fly with the best of them.
